On the second round, candidates were to perform and answer questions according to the judges. The Top 350 candidates were kept for the final round.
Di babak final, para kandidat harus melakukan pemeriksaan tarian dan tampil di atas panggung. Hanya 120 Teratas yang disimpan untuk hasilnya..
